From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:53:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Append DBX updates to the retained baseline

[ouroBIOS: commit f7cbaab0d5a2 of MrChromebox's edk2, without the files
that TianoCore's tree does not have (tools/edk2-import.py): 3 in
edk2/OuroBiosPkg]

Enroll the complete Microsoft DBX first, then append the newer signed
update so factory Setup Mode keeps older revocations. Publish the same
union in dbxDefault for Secure Boot UI and fwupd version detection.
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dec | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

